kesenai</span></p><p begin="2:09.890" end="2:11.970" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.890" end="2:10.410">認</span><span begin="2:10.410" end="2:10.760">め</span><span begin="2:10.760" end="2:11.080">な</span><span begin="2:11.080" end="2:11.370">い</span><span begin="2:11.370" end="2:11.770">か</span><span begin="2:11.770" end="2:11.970">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因我不愿承认</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因我不願承認</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I refuse to admit it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">인정하지 않으니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que je refuse de l’admettre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque me niego a aceptarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil ich es nicht anerkennen will</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque me recuso a admitir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что я не хочу этого признавать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché mi rifiuto di ammetterlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mitomenai kara</span></p><p begin="2:24.050" end="2:29.660" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.050" end="2:24.390">閉</span><span begin="2:24.390" end="2:24.710">ざ</span><span begin="2:24.710" end="2:25.390">し</span><span begin="2:25.390" end="2:25.760">た</span><span begin="2:25.760" end="2:26.060">意</span><span begin="2:26.060" end="2:26.410">味</span><span begin="2:26.730" end="2:27.010">を</span><span begin="2:27.010" end="2:27.700">探</span><span begin="2:27.700" end="2:28.080">し</span><span begin="2:28.080" end="2:28.410">合</span><span begin="2:28.410" end="2:28.750">う</span><span begin="2:28.750" end="2:29.110">よ</span><span begin="2:29.110" end="2:29.460">う</span><span begin="2:29.460" end="2:29.660">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同寻找封闭的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同尋找封閉的意義</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">As though searching together for the meaning we sealed away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">닫혀 버린 의미를 서로 찾아 헤매듯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme si nous cherchions ensemble le sens que nous avions enfermé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si buscáramos juntos el significado que encerramos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Als würden wir gemeinsam nach der verschlossenen Bedeutung suchen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como se procurássemos juntos o sentido que encerramos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Будто вместе ищем смысл того что было заперто</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come se cercassimo insieme un significato ormai sigillato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tozashita imi o sagashiau you ni</span></p><p begin="2:30.080" end="2:34.990" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.080" end="2:30.410">お</span><span begin="2:30.410" end="2:31.100">互</span><span begin="2:31.100" end="2:31.410">い</span><span begin="2:31.410" end="2:31.740">の</span><span begin="2:31.740" end="2:32.420">今</span><span begin="2:32.420" end="2:32.720">を</span><span begin="2:32.720" end="2:33.030">気</span><span begin="2:33.030" end="2:33.380">づ</span><span begin="2:33.380" end="2:33.760">か</span><span begin="2:33.760" end="2:34.060">ぬ</span><span begin="2:34.060" end="2:34.420">よ</span><span begin="2:34.420" end="2:34.760">う</span><span begin="2:34.760" end="2:34.990">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同忽略彼此的当下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同忽略彼此的當下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">As though neither of us should notice who we are now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">서로의 지금을 알아차리지 못하도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour ne pas voir le présent l’un de l’autre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si evitáramos darnos cuenta del presente del otro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Als wollten wir beide das Heute des anderen nicht bemerken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como se não percebêssemos o presente um do outro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Будто стараемся не замечать чем каждый из нас живёт сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come per non accorgerci del presente l&apos;uno dell&apos;altra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Otagai no ima o kizukanu you ni</span></p><p begin="2:35.390" end="2:39.700" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.390" end="2:35.730">あ</span><span begin="2:35.730" end="2:36.070">な</span><span begin="2:36.070" end="2:36.400">た</span><span begin="2:36.400" end="2:36.740">だ</span><span begin="2:36.740" end="2:37.080">け</span><span begin="2:37.080" end="2:37.420">は</span><span begin="2:37.420" end="2:37.740">わ</span><span begin="2:37.740" end="2:38.070">か</span><span begin="2:38.070" end="2:38.390">ら</span><span begin="2:38.390" end="2:38.740">ぬ</span><span begin="2:38.740" end="2:39.070">よ</span><span begin="2:39.070" end="2:39.410">う</span><span begin="2:39.410" end="2:39.700">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯独不能让你知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">唯獨不能讓你知曉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So that you alone will never understand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너만큼은 알지 못하도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour que toi au moins tu ne comprennes pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si solo tú nunca llegaras a saberlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Damit ausgerechnet du es niemals verstehst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como se só você jamais pudesse entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы только ты ничего не понял</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come se soltanto tu non dovessi capirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Anata dake wa wakaranu you ni</span></p><p begin="2:40.000" end="2:45.030" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.000" end="2:40.750">全</span><span begin="2:40.750" end="2:41.390">て</span><span begin="2:41.390" end="2:41.670">が</span><span begin="2:42.000" end="2:42.730">君</span><span begin="2:42.730" end="2:42.980">を</span><span begin="2:43.350" end="2:44.010">殺</span><span begin="2:44.010" end="2:44.380">す</span><span begin="2:44.380" end="2:44.780">か</span><span begin="2:44.780" end="2:45.030">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因万物都将扼杀你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因萬物都將扼殺你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because everything will destroy you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 것이 너를 죽여 버릴 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que tout finira par te tuer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque todo terminará destruyéndote</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn all das wird dich zugrunde richten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque tudo acabará matando você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что всё это убьёт тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché ogni cosa finirà per ucciderti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Subete ga kimi o korosu kara</span></p><p begin="2:46.060" end="2:48.060" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.060" end="2:46.740">No</span><span begin="2:46.740" end="2:46.940">ti</span><span begin="2:46.940" end="2:47.100">ce</span> <span begin="2:47.100" end="2:47.730">no</span><span begin="2:47.730" end="2:47.970">ti</span><span begin="2:47.970" end="2:48.060">ce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉吧 察觉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">察覺吧 察覺吧</span><span ttm:role="x