" end="2:52.070">崩</span><span begin="2:52.070" end="2:52.360">れ</span><span begin="2:52.360" end="2:52.730">合</span><span begin="2:52.730" end="2:53.060">う</span><span begin="2:53.060" end="2:53.380">言</span><span begin="2:53.380" end="2:53.700">い</span><span begin="2:53.700" end="2:54.410">訳</span><span begin="2:54.410" end="2:54.690">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互崩塌的借口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">相互崩塌的藉口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Our crumbling excuses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">서로 무너져 내리는 변명 속에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec des excuses qui s’effondrent les unes sur les autres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entre excusas que se derrumban unas sobre otras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zwischen all den Ausreden die ineinander zerfallen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Entre desculpas que desmoronam umas sobre as outras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наши рушащиеся оправдания</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tra scuse che crollano l&apos;una sull&apos;altra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kuzureau iiwake de</span></p><p begin="2:55.060" end="2:56.690" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.060" end="2:55.390">混</span><span begin="2:55.390" end="2:55.600">ざ</span><span begin="2:55.600" end="2:55.730">っ</span><span begin="2:55.730" end="2:55.950">て</span><span begin="2:55.950" end="2:56.070">い</span><span begin="2:56.070" end="2:56.230">く</span><span begin="2:56.230" end="2:56.400">ん</span><span begin="2:56.400" end="2:56.690">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐交融一体</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漸漸交融一體</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Keep blending into one another</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">뒤섞여 가는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout finit par se mêler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo acaba mezclándose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vermischt sich alles miteinander</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo vai se misturando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Смешиваются друг с другом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutto finisce per confondersi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mazatte ikun da</span></p><p begin="2:56.720" end="2:58.730" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.720" end="2:57.420">For</span><span begin="2:57.420" end="2:57.720">get</span> <span begin="2:57.720" end="2:58.420">for</span><span begin="2:58.420" end="2:58.730">get</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘却吧 忘却吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">忘卻吧 忘卻吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">忘れて 忘れて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잊어 잊어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oublie oublie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Olvida olvida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vergiss es vergiss es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esqueça esqueça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забудь забудь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimentica dimentica</span></p><p begin="2:59.060" end="3:00.990" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.060" end="2:59.420">忘</span><span begin="2:59.420" end="2:59.730">れ</span><span begin="2:59.730" end="3:00.030">て</span><span begin="3:00.030" end="3:00.410">し</span><span begin="3:00.410" end="3:00.760">ま</span><span begin="3:00.760" end="3:00.990">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都遗忘吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">全都遺忘吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just forget it all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 잊어 버려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oublie tout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Olvídalo todo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vergiss es einfach</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esqueça tudo de uma vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забудь же всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimentica tutto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wasurete shimae</span></p><p begin="3:01.370" end="3:06.350" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.370" end="3:01.720">す</span><span begin="3:01.720" end="3:02.010">れ</span><span begin="3:02.010" end="3:02.740">違</span><span begin="3:02.740" end="3:03.030">う</span><span begin="3:03.030" end="3:03.360">視</span><span begin="3:03.360" end="3:04.080">線</span><span begin="3:04.080" end="3:04.300">は</span><span begin="3:04.300" end="3:04.750">知</span><span begin="3:04.750" end="3:05.060">ら</span><span begin="3:05.060" end="3:05.400">な</span><span begin="3:05.400" end="3:05.710">い</span><span begin="3:05.710" end="3:06.070">か</span><span begin="3:06.070" end="3:06.350">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然不识交错的目光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然不識交錯的目光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I know nothing of those glances passing by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">스쳐 가는 시선은 아무것도 모르니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que nos regards qui se croisent ne savent rien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque las miradas que se cruzan no saben nada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn unsere Blicke die sich kreuzen wissen von nichts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque nada sabemos dos olhares que se cruzam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь наши разминувшиеся взгляды ничего не знают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché gli sguardi che si incrociano non sanno nulla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Surechigau shisen wa shiranai kara</span></p><p begin="3:06.740" end="3:09.340" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.740" end="3:07.060">ホ</span><span begin="3:07.060" end="3:07.390">オ</span><span begin="3:07.390" end="3:07.620">ズ</span><span begin="3:07.620" end="3:07.750">キ</span><span begin="3:07.750" end="3:07.900">の</span><span begin="3:07.900" end="3:08.420">花</span><span begin="3:08.420" end="3:08.590">が</span><span begin="3:08.590" end="3:08.780">咲</span><span begin="3:08.780" end="3:08.940">い</span><span begin="3:08.940" end="3:09.100">た</span><span begin="3:09.100" end="3:09.340">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若酸浆花盛开之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若酸漿花盛開之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When the winter cherry blooms</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">꽈리꽃이 피어나면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand fleuriront les physalis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando florezcan los farolillos japoneses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn die Lampionblumen blühen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando as flores de physalis desabrocharem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда зацветёт физалис</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando sbocceranno i fiori dell&apos;alchechengi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hoozuki no hana ga saitara</span></p><p begin="3:09.700" end="3:12.200" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:09.700" end="3:10.060">君</span><span begin="3:10.060" end="3:10.260">を</span><span begin="3:10.260" end="3:10.400">連</span><span begin="3:10.400" end="3:10.610">れ</span><span begin="3:10.610" end="3:10.740">て</span><span begin="3:10.740" end="3:11.080">街</span><span begin="3:11.080" end="3:11.260">の</span><span begin="3:11.260" end="3:11.590">風</span><span begin="3:11.590" end="3:11.750">に</span><span begin="3:11.750" end="3:11.980">な</span><span begin="3:11.980" end="3:12.090">ろ</span><span begin="3:12.090" end="3:12.200">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便带你化作街巷的风</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">便帶你化作街巷的風</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;ll take you with me and become the wind through the city</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너를 데리고 거리의 바람이 되자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t’emmènerai et nous deviendrons le vent de la ville</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te llevaré conmigo y nos volveremos el viento de la ciudad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nehme ich dich mit und wir werden zum Wind der Stadt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou levar você comigo e nos tornaremos o vento da cidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я уведу тебя с собой и мы станем ветром этого города</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti porterò con me e diventeremo il vento della città</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi o tsurete machi no kaze ni narou</span></p><p begin="3:12.390" end="3:14.710" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.390" end="3:12.610">あ</span><span begin="3:12.610" end="3:12.740">の</span><span begin="3:12.740" end="3:12.960">日</span><span begin="3:12.960" end="3:13.080">の</span><span begin="3:13.080" end="3:13.250">意</span><span begin="3:13.250" end="3:13.410">味</span><span begin="3:13.410" end="3:13.640">も</span><span begin="3:13.640" end="3:13.750">ま</span><span begin="3:13.750" end="3:13.930">や</span><span begin="3:13.930" end="3:14.240">か</span><span begin="3:14.240" end="3:14.410">し</span><span begin="3:14.410" end="3:14.710">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那日的意义与虚妄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那日的意義與虛妄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The meaning of that day and every illusion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그날의 의미도 거짓된 환상도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le sens de ce jour-là comme ses illusions</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El significado de aquel día y también sus engaños</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Bedeutung jenes Tages und all seine Täuschungen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O significado daquele dia e todas as ilusões</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И смысл того дня и все иллюзии</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il significato di quel giorno e ogni illusione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ano hi no imi mo mayakashi mo</span></p><p begin="3:14.710" end="3:17.360" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.710" end="3:15.060">全</span><span begin="3:15.060" end="3:15.240">部</span><span begin="3:15.240" end="3:15.740">忘</span><span begin="3:15.740" end="3:16.080">れ</span><span begin="3:16.080" end="3:16.240">な</span><span begin="3:16.240" end="3:16.390">い</span><span begin="3:16.390" end="3:16.740">よ</span><span begin="3:16.740" end="3:17.090">う</span><span begin="3:17.090" end="3:17.360">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为全部铭记</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只為全部銘記</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So that I never forget any of it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모두 잊지 않도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour ne rien oublier de tout cela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Para no olvidar nada de ello</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Damit wir nichts davon jemals vergessen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para que eu jamais me esqueça de nada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы ничего из этого не забыть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per non dimenticare nulla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zenbu wasurenai you ni</span></p><p begin="3:17.730" end="3:20.080" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.730" end="3:18.080">君</span><span begin="3:18.080" end="3:18.300">と</span><span begin="3:18.300" end="3:18.640">笑</span><span begin="3:18.640" end="3:18.750">う</span><span begin="3:18.750" end="3:19.090">夏</span><span begin="3:19.090" end="3:19.290">の</span><span begin="3:19.290" end="3:19.610">日</span><span begin="3:19.610" end="3:19.750">々</span><span begin="3:19.750" end="3:20.080">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你欢笑的夏日时光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與你歡笑的夏日時光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Those summer days when I laughed with you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너와 함께 웃던 여름날들을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces jours d’été où je riais avec toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los días de verano en que reí contigo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">An die Sommertage an denen ich mit dir lachte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dos dias de verão em que sorrimos juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Те летние дни когда мы смеялись вместе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quei giorni d&apos;estate in cui ridevo con te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi to warau natsu no hibi o</span></p><p begin="3:20.390" end="3:24.070" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.390" end="3:20.700">何</span><span begin="3:20.700" end="3:21.070">十</span><span begin="3:21.070" end="3:21.410">年</span><span begin="3:21.410" end="3:21.660">だ</span><span begin="3:21.660" end="3:21.720">っ</span><span begin="3:21.720" end="3:21.930">て</span><span begin="3:21.930" end="3:22.260">思</span><span begin="3:22.260" end="3:22.400">い</span><span begin="3:22.400" end="3:22.690">出</span><span begin="3:22.690" end="3:22.900">す</span><span begin="3:22.900" end="3:23.060">ん</span><span begin="3:23.060" end="3:23.270">だ</span><span begin="3:23.270" end="3:24.070">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵过数十年仍将忆起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">縱過數十年仍將憶起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;ll remember them even decades from now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">몇십 년이 지나도 다시 떠올릴 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même dans des dizaines d’années je m’en souviendrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los recordaré aunque pasen décadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich mich selbst nach Jahrzehnten noch erinnern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo depois de décadas ainda vou me lembrar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду вспоминать их даже спустя десятки лет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Li ricorderò anche tra decine d&apos;anni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nanjuunen datte omoidasun da yo</span></p><p begin="3:25.650" end="3:31.600" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:25.650" end="3:26.050">真</span><span begin="3:26.050" end="3:26.750">実</span><span begin="3:26.750" end="3:27.080">を</span><span begin="3:27.080" end="3:27.400">ま</span><span begin="3:27.400" end="3:27.720">や</span><span begin="3:27.720" end="3:28.030">か</span><span begin="3:28.030" end="3:28.740">し</span><span begin="3:28.740" end="3:31.600">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因若继续欺瞒真实</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因若繼續欺瞞真實</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Disguising the truth as illusion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">진실을 거짓으로 덧칠하고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">En travestissant la vérité</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Disfrazando la verdad con engaños</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich verschleiere die Wahrheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Disfarçando a verdade com ilusões</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Искажая правду иллюзией</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continuando a mascherare la verità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shinjitsu o mayakashite</span></p><p begin="3:32.350" end="3:39.390" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.350" end="3:32.710">気</span><span begin="3:32.710" end="3:33.090">づ</span><span begin="3:33.090" end="3:33.410">い</span><span begin="3:33.410" end="3:33.690">て</span><span begin="3:33.690" end="3:34.070">し</span><span begin="3:34.070" end="3:35.690">ま</span><span begin="3:35.690" end="3:36.060">う</span><span begin="3:36.060" end="3:36.430">か</span><span begin="3:36.430" end="3:39.390">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终将被你察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">終將被你察覺</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I know I&apos;ll realize it in the end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">결국 알아차리고 말 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que je finirai malgré moi par m’en rendre compte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque acabaré dándome cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil ich sie sonst doch erkennen würde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque no fim acabarei percebendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что иначе я всё пойму</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché finirei comunque per accorgermene</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizuite shimau kara</span></p></div></body></tt>